@18001 = ~Living Black Blade of Disaster~
@18002 = ~The Living Black Blade of Disaster becomes Berserk~
@18003 = ~This tapestry lists the names of all the heroes who died in one of the challenges. You recognize none of the names listed. Most of the challenges mentioned do not match those offered to you by the golem.~
@18004 = ~This tapestry lists the names of all the heroes who managed to reach the final challenge. However, it does not say whether they managed to defeat the ultimate boss. One of the names has been scratched out.~
@18005 = ~This tapestry lists the names of all the heroes who distinguished themselves in the challenges. You can read feats such as "Completed all the challenges in just one hour and five minutes", "Destroyed two bosses with a single spell", etc. Curiously, one name in the middle of the list has been scratched out. The feat reads: "Impressed the master so much that they never came back out".~
@18006 = ~This tapestry lists every series of challenges that was ever created. It seems that several different series have existed and that the one you are attempting now is unique, aside from "The Forge", which appears in other lists. The last entry lists the ten challenges the golem offered you, plus three others it did not: "The Library", "The Gallery of Anomalies", and "The Pasture".~
@18007 = ~Temporal Vortex~
@18008 = ~Untitled Journal~
@18009 = ~What was that?
That black mist came out of nowhere. It touched Nomelie and she was gone. Just gone.
Gorog hit it, and he vanished too.
Then it went for Shakane. She dodged it, but she disappeared anyway.
She wasn't teleported. I would know. She wasn't sent anywhere. She just... vanished.
The mist started coming toward me. I used the Chaotic Exit Key and got out. I ended up here.
I think I'm safe now.
But where is “here”?
And what is that crackling in the air?~

